[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-2027-daad-doctoral-scholarship-program-in-germany-fully-funded-for-international-students-291":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},291,"2027-daad-doctoral-scholarship-program-in-germany-fully-funded-for-international-students-291","2027 Daad Doctoral Scholarship Program In Germany: Fully Funded For International Students","\u003Cp>The DAAD Doctoral Scholarship Program is a fully funded scholarship that offers €1,400\u002Fm stipends, health, accident and personal liability insurance and travel and research allowance.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>DAAD PhD Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>For 100 years, the DAAD has been promoting international academic exchange, creating perspectives, connecting worlds and fostering innovation. It offered various scholarship across all academics levels.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The doctoral scholarship programme offers you the opportunity to complete your doctoral degree in Germany. The scholarships are funded by the German Federal Foreign Office.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>You can apply if you have above-average qualifications and you completed your Master’s degree or Diplom, or in exceptional cases a Bachelor’s degree, at the latest by the time the funding period begins.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>DAAD Doctoral Scholarship Program 2027 Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The DAAD Doctoral Scholarship Program offers the following benefits for a maximum of four years;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly payments of 1,400 euros\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Payments towards health, accident and personal liability insurance cover \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel allowance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>annual research allowance of € 4600\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>monthly rent subsidy \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>monthly allowance for accompanying family members\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>DAAD PhD Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the DAAD PhD Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>not have graduated any longer than six years before the application deadline\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>If you have already started your doctorate, it also applies that the start of the doctorate should not be longer than 3 years ago.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Your application \u003Cstrong>cannot\u003C\u002Fstrong> be considered, if you have been resident in Germany for longer than 15 months at the application deadline.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A Bachelor of Arts\u002FBachelor of \u003Ca class=\"google-anno\" href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fdaad-doctoral-scholarship-program\u002F#\"> \u003Cu>Science\u003C\u002Fu>\u003C\u002Fa> degree of 2nd class upper division level and a Master of Arts\u002FMaster of Science degree are required\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Good German language skills – especially for students taking arts subjects – are usually a requirement for study and research projects in Germany. Exceptions are possible if the project is carried out in English.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A prior language course of 4 to 6 months is generally included in the scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>DAAD PhD Scholarship Program 2026 Required Documents\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the DAAD PhD Scholarship 2026, you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Online application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Full \u003Cstrong>curriculum vitae\u003C\u002Fstrong> in tabular form (max. 3 pages) in Europass CV Format\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>List of publications (10 pages max).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Letter of motivation (1-2 pages).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Research proposal\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Schedule for planned research work.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Letter of admission to a study program.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>All degree certificate and transcripts.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Supporting letter of recommendation.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proof of English Language Skills.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for DAAD Doctoral Scholarship Program 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the DAAD Doctoral Scholarship Program 2026, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prepare the required documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visit application Page to apply\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Deadline: September 24th, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Apply here: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww2.daad.de\u002Fdeutschland\u002Fstipendium\u002Fdatenbank\u002Fen\u002F21148-scholarship-database\u002F?origin=165&amp;status=4&amp;subjectGrps=&amp;daad=&amp;q=&amp;page=1&amp;detail=57135739#voraussetzungen\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww2.daad.de\u002Fdeutschland\u002Fstipendium\u002Fdatenbank\u002Fen\u002F21148-scholarship-database\u002F?origin=165&amp;status=4&amp;subjectGrps=&amp;daad=&amp;q=&amp;page=1&amp;detail=57135739#voraussetzungen\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-06-17 10:55:06",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2027-daad-doctoral-scholarship-program-in-germany-fully-funded-for-international-students\u002F6a326efab74be3.72912220_screenshot 2026-06-17 092423.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2027-daad-doctoral-scholarship-program-in-germany-fully-funded-for-international-students\u002F6a326efab74be3.72912220_screenshot%202026-06-17%20092423.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":47},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[43],{"fileName":44,"oldFileName":44,"type":18,"file":19,"url":45},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-20